      ro: "Un important pod rutier \\u00een Maevatanana, care traverseaz\\u0103 r\\u00e2ul ro\\u0219u Betsiboka \\u0219i face leg\\u0103tura \\u00eentre Antananarivo \\u0219i Mahajanga.",
